    "detailed_description": "The time has come when people need your environmental orientation skills.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this casual game, you will be the guide of several travelers who got lost and need to reach their desired destination. Unfortunately, you will not set a good example for others, but instead, you will help someone cross the street safely without being put at risk of being hit by a car.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEveryone is counting on you, and take care that no one needs unpleasant news in the city. No car is coming? Let's run away!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features :<br />\r\n- 15 levels<br />\r\n- Heavy traffic<br />\r\n- Several groups of tourists",
